{"id":"n87740-3-8","stage":4,"title":"훑다 · 打量","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87740-3-8-1","ko":"이번에 여행을 가서 구경을 많이 하고 왔니?","zh":"这次旅行参观了很多地方吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번에","audio":"/audio/46d83053c21d45a8f49f.mp3"}},{"text":"여행을","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여행을","audio":"/audio/8e4d1a5a7460b5dcfa6a.mp3"}},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가서","audio":"/audio/0a4296790d3f4b0e6e6b.mp3"}},{"text":"구경을","meaning":"赏，观看，游览","explanation":"구경：赏，观看，游览；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"구경","audio":"/audio/f7bcc82cf5b9252f8050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64484","senseId":"3","lemma":"구경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구경을","audio":"/audio/e5322687940296a465e9.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"하고","meaning":"做、进行（구경을 하다：参观游览）","explanation":"하다：做、进行（구경을 하다：参观游览）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하고","audio":"/audio/1a7140c02481d065b267.mp3"}},{"text":"왔니?","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔니","audio":"/audio/fcfe3eb77392c7ddf554.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。","pronunciation":["여행"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"f7bcc82cf5b9252f","term":"구경","zh":"赏，观看，游览","audio":"/audio/f7bcc82cf5b9252f8050.mp3","entryId":"64484","definition":"用眼睛看或亲自体验。","pronunciation":["구ː경"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做、进行（구경을 하다：参观游览）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做、进行（구경을 하다：参观游览）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/007ead9842572542ebce.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87740-3-8-2","ko":"네. 유럽의 다섯 나라를 쭉 훑었어요.","zh":"是的，大致游览了欧洲五个国家。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseI